#. ID 1, Page 1, Line 3063, Pos (19,14)
msgid ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]自動曲送り\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>＞指定した条件で自動曲送りする機能です"
msgstr ""
"\\>\\C[10]■ \\C[6]Autoplay\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>> This function plays tracks automatically\n"
"\\>  with specified conditions"

#. ID 1, Page 1, Line 3071, Pos (19,14)
msgid ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]自動曲送り\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>＞リストに未解放が長く続く箇所があると\n"
"\\>　切り替えに\\C[1]時間がかかります"
msgstr ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]Autoplay\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>> If there are a lot of locked tracks in a row,\n"
"\\>  it may \\C[1]take a long time"

#. ID 1, Page 1, Line 3075, Pos (19,14)
msgid ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]自動曲送り\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>＞リストに星が\\C[1]1つもつかない区間がある\\C[0]時は\n"
"\\>　注意してください"
msgstr ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]Autoplay\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>> Please note that if there is a track\n"
"\\>  with \\C[1]no stars awarded\\C[0], a pause will occur"

#. ID 1, Page 1, Line 3079, Pos (19,14)
msgid ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]自動曲送り\\C[0]\n"
"\\>\n"
"\\>＞演出解放数4/609の場合、SRNo.3D→45で\\C[1]5秒\\C[0]程度\n"
"\\>　SRNo.45→1Aで\\C[1]30秒\\C[0]程度止まります"
msgstr ""
"\\>\\C[10]■\\C[6]Autoplay\\C[0]\n"
"\\>> If 4/609 variants are unlocked:\n"
"\\>  SR No. 3D→45 pauses for approx. \\C[1]5 seconds\\C[0],\n"
"\\>　and SR No. 45→1A pauses for approx. \\C[1]30 seconds\\C[0]"

